{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo of Ironsand. It includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels with unique Mech Titans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 types of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 types of characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/extras/all_guns.gif?t=1746122574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-op for up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight cultists with your friends! Develop a strategy, use different skills and weapons, mix game styles and free the galaxy from the cruel followers of the Cult of the Iron God</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/extras/titan_spider.gif?t=1746122574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 4 active skills at your disposal. Engineers can build turrets, medics can heal the team, defenders are able to set up energy shields and berserkers briefly causes huge damage to opponents</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map randomization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each death, the map will partially change. Don't even try to remember the way to the Titan - the desert is changeable</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sci-fi weapons and armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Galactic union is ready to provide you with the best weapons to destroy the cultists. Destroy your enemies with plasma, burn them with lasers and blast them with rockets, they deserve it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destructibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has a large number of destructible buildings, bridges and beams. Why not fire a rocket at the wall your friend is standing on? It's fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698710?t=1746122574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698710?t=1746122574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/add320ca79bb03450bccc490f0d3ef0aa0ea3005/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746122574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/add320ca79bb03450bccc490f0d3ef0aa0ea3005/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746122574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is violence in our game in the form of murders and dismemberment of people, insects and robots"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo of Ironsand. It includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels with unique Mech Titans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">14 types of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 types of characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/extras/all_guns.gif?t=1746122574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Co-op for up to 4 players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight cultists with your friends! Develop a strategy, use different skills and weapons, mix game styles and free the galaxy from the cruel followers of the Cult of the Iron God</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/extras/titan_spider.gif?t=1746122574\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Active skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 4 active skills at your disposal. Engineers can build turrets, medics can heal the team, defenders are able to set up energy shields and berserkers briefly causes huge damage to opponents</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Map randomization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each death, the map will partially change. Don't even try to remember the way to the Titan - the desert is changeable</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sci-fi weapons and armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Galactic union is ready to provide you with the best weapons to destroy the cultists. Destroy your enemies with plasma, burn them with lasers and blast them with rockets, they deserve it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destructibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has a large number of destructible buildings, bridges and beams. Why not fire a rocket at the wall your friend is standing on? It's fun!</p>","developers":["Renderise"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2454600","name":"Ironsand"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698710/6238ddb4604cb18f1681d97f09dd2fca3867ae63/header.jpg?t=1746122574","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130425,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130425/movie480.mp4?t=1745854216","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130425/movie_max.mp4?t=1745854216"},"name":"trailer-story-1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130425/67e6a9e4457b745a79ad090172f9b4ae8b5bcb80/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745854216","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130425/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745854216","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130425/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745854216"}}],"name":"Ironsand Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or AMD equivalent (AMD FX 8500+ Series)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<